Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:01.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}India's tectonic plate
Dialogue: 5,0:00:01.53,0:00:02.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}is pushing under Tibet.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:03.08,0:00:03.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}But the weird part
Dialogue: 5,0:00:03.94,0:00:05.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}is what may be\Nhappening underneath.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:05.93,0:00:07.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}That slow collision helps
Dialogue: 5,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}build the Himalayas.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Now, a twenty\Ntwenty-five seismic study
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.86,0:00:12.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}suggests something deeper:
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}parts of the\Nplate's mantle layer
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.36,0:00:16.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}may be tearing and peeling away
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.44,0:00:17.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}from its crust.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}That's inferred from\Nseismic evidence,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.57,0:00:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}not a surface split.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}The country isn't disappearing.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}Those enormous mountains
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.03,0:00:25.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}are just the surface
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.07,0:00:26.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}of a much bigger collision.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.95,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,90)}INDIA IS MOVING\NUNDER TIBET
